Elimination -- eliminating specified variables, and Sylvester resultant
***********************************************************************

Description
===========

This package contains functions to eliminate variables from an ideal (that is,
intersect an ideal with a subring generated by certain of the variables), and
to compute Sylvester resultants.

It would be nice to implement multivariate resultants, Bezoutians, and sparse
resultants.  Laurent Buse has written code for this in the past. We hope to
provide a package, Resultants, which will do this.  If you are willing to help
write this, please contact the author if this package!

Author
======

  * Michael E. Stillman <mike@math.cornell.edu>

