discriminant(RingElement,RingElement)
*************************************

  * Function: *note discriminant: discriminant_lpRingElement_cmRingElement_rp,
  * Usage: 
        discriminant(f,x)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, a polynomial
      * x, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, a variable in the
        same ring
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Algorithm (missing documentation) => ..., default value null, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, the discriminant of f
        with respect to x

Description
===========

+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[x,a,b,c,d]                               |
|                                                         |
|o1 = R                                                   |
|                                                         |
