+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = x^2+a*x+b                                       |
|                                                         |
|      2                                                  |
|o2 = x  + x*a + b                                        |
|                                                         |
|o2 : R                                                   |
+---------------------------------------------------------+
