sylvesterMatrix(RingElement,RingElement,RingElement)
****************************************************

  * Function: *note sylvesterMatrix:
    sylvesterMatrix_lpRingElement_cmRingElement_cmRingElement_rp,
  * Usage: 
        sylvesterMatrix(f,g,x)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, a polynomial in a
        ring R
      * g, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, a polynomial in
        the same ring
      * x, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, a variable in R
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the Sylvester matrix of f and g
        with respect to x

Description
===========

Its determinant is the resultant of f and g.
